# tessera-idp · SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
#
# Keep the build context to sources. Everything listed here is either
# regenerated inside the image or has no business in it.
#
# node_modules is the load-bearing entry, not just a size optimisation: the
# theme stage runs `npm ci` and then copies themes/ratio/ over the result, so a
# node_modules from the host would overwrite Linux binaries with whatever the
# host platform installed. On macOS that leaves rollup with only its darwin
# build and the theme fails to compile — a failure that never reaches CI,
# because a fresh checkout there has nothing to copy.

# --- Dependencies & build output (regenerated in-image) ---
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/dist_keycloak

# --- Test artifacts ---
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright

# --- VCS & CI (not read by any build stage) ---
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Editors / OS ---
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
